(a) whether Government has identified sector-wise employment patterns in India's million-plus cities under the latest employment statistics;
(b) if so, the details of employment distribution across major sectors including transport, storage and communication, services, manufacturing, agriculture and casual labour;
(c) whether the share of regular salaried employment has increased in million-plus cities over the last few years;
(d) whether self-employed workers in million-plus cities earn higher average monthly incomes than their counterparts in other urban areas; and
(e) if so, the policy initiatives being undertaken to generate formal and better-paying jobs in urban areas?
