(c) whether Larsen & Toubro has already dispatched four of the eight steam generators required for the upcoming units; and
(d) whether addition of these units forms part of Government's broader plan to expand nuclear power capacity under the fleet-mode programme and if so, the details thereof?

(a) whether it is a fact that compensation payable to land losers under the Bengaluru Satellite Town Ring Road (STRR) project is still pending;
(b) whether the prolonged delay in settlement of compensation has adversely affected the livelihood of the displaced landowners;
(c) whether Government has fixed any timeline for clearing all outstanding compensation dues under the project;
(d) whether any special measures are being implemented to ensure early resolution of compensation-related grievances of the affected persons; and
(e) if so, the details thereof?

